---
export interface Props {
  /** The section's own docx heading — rendered inside the floating badge. */
  title?: string;
  as?: "h1" | "h2" | "h3" | "h4" | "h5" | "h6";
  /** Column labels. These are card furniture rather than docx sections, so they
   *  render as <p> carrying the same classes a heading would. */
  titleleft?: string;
  titleright?: string;
}
const { title, as: HeadingTag = "h2", titleleft, titleright } = Astro.props;

// The badge is width-capped (w-[92%] max-w-2xl) and centred rather than
// whitespace-nowrap, so a full docx sentence wraps instead of blowing past the
// viewport and forcing horizontal scroll on a phone.
//
// It is absolutely positioned at -top-6, so the card's top padding has to clear
// the badge's own height minus that 24px offset. RE-DERIVED for WIN999's docx H2
// #5, "หมดปัญหาเรื่องระบบปิดปรับปรุง ทางเข้า WIN999 ล่าสุด เล่นได้ตลอด 24 ชั่วโมง" —
// 74 code points, ~61 advancing glyphs once the 13 zero-width Thai marks
// (ั ื ่ ิ ั ุ ้ ่ ุ ่ ้ ั ่) are discounted. That is 22 glyphs LONGER than
// BRAZIL999's title, which is what the old pt-32 was sized against, so the
// arithmetic is redone rather than inherited. The heading carries
// `leading-normal` (1.5), the badge adds py-2.5 (20px) and border-2 (4px), and
// the two ✦ spans plus gap-2 take ~48px of the line box. Budget is one line
// beyond the measured wrap at every breakpoint:
//   base  text-base 16px -> 24px/line, ~247px of text width at 360px
//         (w-[92%] 331 - px-4 32 - border 4 - sparks 48) = ~30 glyphs/line,
//         so 61 glyphs wraps to 3. Budget 4 lines = 4x24 + 24 = 120px,
//         bottom edge 96px vs pt-32/128px             -> 32px clear
//   sm    text-xl 20px -> 30px/line, ~473px of text width = ~47 glyphs/line,
//         wraps to 2. Budget 3 lines = 3x30 + 24 = 114px,
//         bottom edge 90px vs pt-32/128px             -> 38px clear
//   md    text-2xl 24px -> 36px/line, max-w-2xl gives ~556px = ~46 glyphs/line,
//         wraps to 2. Budget 3 lines = 3x36 + 24 = 132px,
//         bottom edge 108px vs pt-32/128px            -> 20px clear
// The md figure is the one that moved: 20px of daylight on a title this long is
// inside rounding error of the glyph-width estimate, so md was bumped pt-32 ->
// md:pt-36 (144px), which restores 36px clear there. base/sm keep pt-32. It was
// once pt-28 with md:pt-24 — md was NEGATIVE the moment the title took three
// lines. Do not push it back down without redoing the arithmetic above.
//
// WIN999 palette (ทอง-ดำ 2026-09-29): การ์ดไล่จากผิวการ์ดดำอมทอง #191712 ลงพื้นเพจ
// ดำสนิท #050505 ในกรอบทองแบรนด์ #fcc403 ป้ายหัวข้อวางบนผิวการ์ดยก #101010 ประกาย
// ซ้ายเป็นทองสว่าง #fdda04 ประกายขวาเป็นขาวนวล #e9e4d6 ตามคู่สีของโลโก้ที่คำว่า WIN
// เป็นทองและเลข 999 เป็นขาว ตัวหัวข้อไล่ขาวไฮไลต์ #fffbea → ทองสว่าง #fdda04 → ทอง
// แบรนด์ #fcc403 ป้ายสองคอลัมน์รับทองสว่าง เนื้อความ #e9e4d6 (BRAND_TEXT) — ชุดเขียว-
// โครเมียมของ BRAZIL999 (#22c55e #7cf25c #b6ff9c #f1f5f9 #0a1a0c #123a18 #040a05
// #dfeadd) ออกทั้งหมด
---

<section class="my-10 flex w-full justify-center px-4 font-sans">
  <div class="relative w-full max-w-7xl rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#fcc403]/45 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#191712] to-[#050505] p-8 pt-32 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgba(3,2,0,0.85)] md:pt-36">
    {
      title && (
        <div class="absolute -top-6 left-1/2 flex w-[92%] max-w-2xl -translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border-2 border-[#fcc403]/70 bg-[#101010] px-4 py-2.5 text-center shadow-[0_5px_15px_rgba(252,196,3,0.32)] sm:px-8">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-[#fdda04]">
            ✦
          </span>
          <HeadingTag class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#fffbea] via-[#fdda04] to-[#fcc403] bg-clip-text text-base leading-normal font-black tracking-tighter text-transparent uppercase sm:text-xl md:text-2xl">
            {title}
          </HeadingTag>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-[#e9e4d6]">
            ✦
          </span>
        </div>
      )
    }

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-left text-base leading-relaxed text-[#e9e4d6]">
        {titleleft && <p class="text-2xl leading-normal font-bold text-[#fdda04] drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(252,196,3,0.32)]">{titleleft}</p>}
        <slot name="left" />
      </article>

      <article class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-left text-base leading-relaxed text-[#e9e4d6] md:border-l md:border-[#fcc403]/35 md:pl-10">
        {titleright && <p class="text-2xl leading-normal font-bold text-[#fdda04] drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(252,196,3,0.32)]">{titleright}</p>}
        <slot name="right" />
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
